Dialogue: 30,0:00:14.74,0:00:16.00,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The purported Entrances,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.92,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,tears in reality that connected \Nthe human world to another dimension,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:20.33,0:00:23.42,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,suddenly appeared all over the planet.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.97,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Every military on the planet suffered a horrible defeat,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:27.97,0:00:32.43,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,without even knowing who they were fighting.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:39.44,0:00:42.94,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The Entrances vanished two weeks after they appeared,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:42.94,0:00:45.32,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,and the danger seemed to have passed.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:45.78,0:00:46.57,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,But then,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.07,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx400\fscy500\fnAGLettericaCondensed\bord0\blur0.45\c&HF9F9F9&\b1\pos(978.591,769.014)}Six Months Ago
