Dialogue: 30,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.07,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,they came back.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:54.12,0:00:57.62,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The world's governments evacuated to oceanic Megafloats.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:57.62,0:01:02.33,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Only a small portion of the world's total population was able to survive.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:03.50,0:01:07.59,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Our world is still being invaded by enemies as we speak,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:07.59,0:01:09.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,pouring in from the open Entrances.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:13.64,0:01:17.18,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But we haven't been sitting here twiddling our thumbs.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:17.18,0:01:20.10,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We've developed the Heart Hybrid Gears,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.35,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,suits capable of fighting the enemy's Magitech weapons.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:22.85,0:01:26.61,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is Ataraxia's ace team, Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:26.61,0:01:29.36,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,They're some of our most important fighters.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.53,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,You all did wonderfully today.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:31.53,0:01:34.28,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,As principal and high commander of Ataraxia,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.66,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:35.66,0:01:39.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan, are you seriously \Nthe principal {\i1}and{\i0} the high commander?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:39.83,0:01:43.75,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,And now we have a way of making the Gears even stronger.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.75,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Making the Gears stronger?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:46.00,0:01:47.25,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'll introduce him.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:47.25,0:01:50.76,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is Hida Kizuna, a second-year student who'll be joining the High School Tactical Division.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:51.26,0:01:55.22,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's already been decided that he'll join Amaterasu upon starting class.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:55.22,0:01:56.76,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is the key to our victory.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.56,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.18,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I thought he was the shy type,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:02.18,0:02:03.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,but I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:05.65,0:02:07.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait, I...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.40,0:02:09.07,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:09.07,0:02:10.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Um, you're...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:12.70,0:02:15.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,High School Tactical Division, Class 2-1,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:15.20,0:02:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Disciplinary Councilwoman Himekawa Hayuru!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:17.49,0:02:20.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What do you think you were doing in the middle of a battle?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:20.87,0:02:22.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:22.29,0:02:23.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's obscene!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Perverted!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.42,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is not a game!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:27.25,0:02:30.42,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,By sharing love and pleasure with Hida Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,the lost energy of a Heart Hybrid Gear can be dramatically restored.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.34,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is called Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:38.14,0:02:39.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Heart Hybrid...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:40.18,0:02:41.27,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,These are your new orders:
Dialogue: 30,0:02:41.27,0:02:45.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,the members of Amaterasu are\N to restore their energy and power up
Dialogue: 30,0:02:45.31,0:02:49.82,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,by doing lewd things with Hida Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:52.82,0:02:55.32,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is true for anyone wanting to join Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:55.32,0:02:59.12,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,After joining, you'll be required\N to perform Heart Hybrid with Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea, everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I definitely didn't think of that as erotic!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:11.34,0:03:13.46,Dialogue Flashback Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:13.51,0:03:16.30,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,He's a pervert!
