Dialogue: 30,0:04:54.61,0:04:57.40,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,How could you sleep in later than me?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:58.03,0:04:59.53,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're slacking off.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.53,0:05:01.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Ch-Chidorigafuchi...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:01.20,0:05:01.91,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:02.49,0:05:03.62,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I've come to seduce you tonight.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:03.62,0:05:05.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's morning.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:05.41,0:05:07.16,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,They call it the "morning walk of shame," right?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Well, maybe, but I think the order's wrong.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.75,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get started.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:12.75,0:05:13.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wai—
Dialogue: 30,0:05:18.30,0:05:22.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,O-Okay, let's do a Heart Hybrid!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:22.43,0:05:24.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,W-Wait a second.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:24.55,0:05:26.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:28.22,0:05:29.73,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Um, Hida-kun?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:29.73,0:05:30.93,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.52,0:05:32.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:33.35,0:05:36.82,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I was thinking that maybe there's a reason for the way you acted yesterday.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.07,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I apologize for getting mad at you
Dialogue: 30,0:05:39.07,0:05:41.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,without hearing your side of the story.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:43.61,0:05:44.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hida-kun?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.49,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm coming in, okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.95,0:05:53.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So, I know this isn't a sufficient apology,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,but I wanted to walk you to school...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.80,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You animal!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:01.80,0:06:04.39,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You took Aine-san to your room to seduce her?!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:04.39,0:06:04.97,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:04.97,0:06:06.97,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How is it not true?!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:06.97,0:06:09.35,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Everything about it isn't true, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:10.47,0:06:12.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm the one going after him.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.39,0:06:15.40,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm trying to seduce him to perform a Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:15.40,0:06:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I've had it!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.61,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:18.94,0:06:21.11,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'll teach you both a lesson!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:22.36,0:06:23.32,Dialogue Alternate,A,0,0,0,,Zeros.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Guys, don't do this in my room!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.16,0:06:32.87,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The explosion in the dorm this morning
Dialogue: 30,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was caused by Himekawa-san and Chidorigafuchi-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:35.62,0:06:36.67,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.38,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It was in that Eros boy's room!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.38,0:06:42.13,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Letting him stay in the girls dorm and \Ntake classes with the girls is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.13,0:06:45.63,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,This is a way of allowing intimacy to develop between them
Dialogue: 30,0:06:45.63,0:06:48.10,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,by spending time together.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,But still, you know...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:52.02,0:06:53.23,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.23,0:06:56.90,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,it's wrong to judge someone based on\N their appearance and first impressions.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:56.90,0:07:01.11,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's not too late to judge him until after you've seen
Dialogue: 30,0:07:01.11,0:07:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,whether or not he's worthy of special treatment.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.95,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How compassionate of you, Julicia-sama!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I feel better just hearing you speak!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:13.33,0:07:14.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah, figures...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.42,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.29,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,M-Morning.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:18.29,0:07:19.79,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, pervert-face!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:19.79,0:07:24.38,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Julicia Farandoll-sama is a rich \NAmerican celebrity and military ace!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:24.38,0:07:27.80,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're not even worthy of speaking to her!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.18,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Now, now. Calm down, everyone.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:30.47,0:07:32.64,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hey, is what the high commander says true?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.64,0:07:34.93,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If I seek pleasure with you,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:34.93,0:07:37.94,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,will my Hybrid Count really be restored?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.94,0:07:40.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I-I don't really know,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.27,0:07:42.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Farandoll-san...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:42.57,0:07:44.61,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Call me Julicia.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.20,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Would you like...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.70,0:07:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to try right now?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.91,0:07:53.83,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,{\q2}Julicia-san, a classroom is a sacred place, \Nand I won't let you do anything lewd here!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.58,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So it's fine as long as we're not in the classroom?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No, it's not fine anywhere!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:58.62,0:07:59.37,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:01.29,0:08:03.21,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Are you busy?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:03.92,0:08:04.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Sylvia Silkcut, first-year middle schooler!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:08.51,0:08:11.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The commander wants to talk to you, Captain Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:13.14,0:08:16.10,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,This is the Heart Hybrid Gear research lab,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.35,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,also known as Nayuta Labs.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:18.69,0:08:22.11,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The basic technology for the Hybrid Gears was developed here.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's Dr. Hida Nayuta, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:28.61,0:08:31.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The super-important person who developed the Gears.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:33.58,0:08:34.54,Dialogue Italics,M,0,0,0,,Mom...
