Dialogue: 30,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Well, don't let it bug you.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.02,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Anyway, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.02,0:09:04.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'll give you this to start with.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:04.57,0:09:08.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's a portable terminal that also \Nfunctions as a student handbook.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.03,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Yours is special.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:10.03,0:09:12.20,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Tap on the icons of the Amaterasu members.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is private information!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.33,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That's why it's special.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:18.33,0:09:21.58,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,You can see one of the listings is for Hybrid Count, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.50,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,When their count goes below five percent,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it gets hard to maintain their Gears.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.67,0:09:28.46,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,"Keep that in mind"?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:30.55,0:09:31.51,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:31.51,0:09:34.22,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,If you perform Heart Hybrid, their count will recover.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:34.76,0:09:38.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Gear energy doesn't recover naturally?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:38.18,0:09:41.06,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Natural recovery takes too long.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:41.06,0:09:44.35,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,And the energy loss in combat is huge.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:44.35,0:09:48.73,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is why we need you and your Gear, Eros.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.73,0:09:52.82,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Our latest research shows that Eros has a special function.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:53.36,0:09:57.37,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Heart Hybrid, a method for drastically restoring Hybrid Counts.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:58.37,0:10:02.33,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's no exaggeration to say that the fate of humanity rests on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.88,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Do your job as captain well.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:04.88,0:10:06.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.05,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm captain?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:08.05,0:10:10.63,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Starting today, you're the captain of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But that's so sudden!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:12.26,0:10:15.26,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Sylvia will help as best as she can!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:15.51,0:10:19.18,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Sylvia will keep me updated on whether things are proceeding smoothly
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,between you and the ladies of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:22.85,0:10:23.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.64,0:10:24.27,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is crazy...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:26.15,0:10:28.52,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Work hard. You've got a mission now.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:29.07,0:10:30.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A mission?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:33.57,0:10:36.03,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I'll go over the mission again.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:36.03,0:10:39.16,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Your job is to gather data on a nearby island
Dialogue: 30,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.91,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,and recover some resource samples.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:40.91,0:10:43.66,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,This is your first mission as Amaterasu's captain.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.79,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Stay sharp out there.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:44.79,0:10:47.58,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How can someone so lewd be our captain?!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.58,0:10:50.67,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead and scope out the area!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:51.17,0:10:52.42,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait a second—
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.67,0:10:54.68,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh, Hayuru, you're so silly.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.55,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Julicia.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.05,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh? What is it, High Commander?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.35,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I want you to be careful.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:00.35,0:11:04.69,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Your Hybrid Count's very low, at 20 percent.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:04.69,0:11:06.73,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,If you encounter the enemy,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:06.73,0:11:08.69,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,avoid combat as much as possible.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:08.98,0:11:11.94,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Don't worry. This place is safe.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:11.94,0:11:15.70,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you worry about your little brother instead?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.45,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like he's flying very steadily...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.66,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll go catch up to Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:23.20,0:11:25.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,They're both so fast.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:25.58,0:11:26.96,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.42,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hayuru is Japan's ace,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:28.42,0:11:31.13,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,and Julicia is America's ace.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.13,0:11:32.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,By the way, how good are you?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:35.92,0:11:37.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Japan's number 2?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Or some other foreign ace?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:40.26,0:11:42.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:42.22,0:11:45.27,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm the entire world's ace.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The entire world's ace?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh no, my bad.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:47.98,0:11:49.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I meant the entire universe.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:49.73,0:11:51.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The entire universe, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.70,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Data recovery has been initiated.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.12,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,It will take two hours or so to finish.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:02.41,0:12:04.54,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,So we get our samples in the meantime?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.83,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:08.12,0:12:10.13,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Make sure you escort me right.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.84,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.18,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You're such a worrywart, aren't you, Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:23.76,0:12:27.52,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,The Entrances only appear on land masses above a certain size.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.35,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So this tiny island's plenty safe.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:29.35,0:12:31.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:31.27,0:12:34.52,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So, what are your Gear's specs?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:35.36,0:12:37.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to answer that.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.86,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.78,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So what's your kill score?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.20,0:12:44.53,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Zero.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:44.53,0:12:47.41,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Then you're really a complete rookie?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:47.41,0:12:48.79,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What about combat experience?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:48.79,0:12:51.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The battle yesterday was my first.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:51.29,0:12:54.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But all I really did was catch \NChidorigafuchi from that fall.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:54.75,0:12:56.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything else, really.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:57.80,0:13:01.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,How many enemies have you defeated, Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:01.38,0:13:02.97,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,About three hundred.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:02.97,0:13:03.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Three—?!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:03.60,0:13:06.31,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I guess that's America's ace for you.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'm not amazing at all.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go regroup with Hayuru and Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.74,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:22.74,0:13:23.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine-san,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.87,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,let's go meet Julicia-san and—
Dialogue: 30,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,An Entrance?!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:30.33,0:13:31.87,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But that can't be!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.58,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Equip your Gear, Hayuru!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.01,Dialogue Alternate,Y,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:28.01,0:14:29.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Ataraxia, come in!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:29.81,0:14:31.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Shikina-san! Nee-chan!
