Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.89,0:14:34.90,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx99.865\xbord3\xshad0\fscy99.865\ybord3\yshad0\fnVirtue\blur0.75\bord0\fscx49.932\fscy49.932\c&HA29F9D&\b1\pos(918.33,525.465)\fax0.04\frx2.669\fry2.669\frz4.81}Connection Failed
Dialogue: 30,0:14:35.19,0:14:36.10,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:36.10,0:14:37.90,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,When an Entrance appears,
Dialogue: 30,0:14:37.90,0:14:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,normal communications stop working.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:40.90,0:14:43.03,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But Gear users can still communicate.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:43.03,0:14:44.65,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Aine? Hayuru?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:46.41,0:14:48.49,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.16,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\bord0\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF8FAF3&\b1\fax-0.1\pos(937.5,495.591)\frx358\fry2\frz20.44\fnUbuntu Condensed}Connection Failed
Dialogue: 30,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.20,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Julicia-san!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.16,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hida-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:57.92,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnUbuntu Condensed\blur0.6\bord0\fscx35\fscy35\c&HFDF9D6&\b1\fax0.1\frx12\fry190\t(2648,3750,\c&HDBC8AC&)\frz24.11\pos(1149.9,823.99)}Connection Failed
Dialogue: 30,0:14:54.66,0:14:55.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's not working.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.25,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hayuru, look!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:59.54,0:15:00.92,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.43,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:09.72,0:15:10.68,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.64,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,We're locked in?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:16.90,0:15:19.56,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna, go get the others.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.57,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But then you'll have to fight on your own.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:21.57,0:15:24.19,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You'll just slow me down!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:24.19,0:15:25.45,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:26.45,0:15:27.57,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:27.57,0:15:28.20,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.91,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:34.20,0:15:36.71,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:38.71,0:15:40.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A girl's risking her life in combat!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:53.89,0:15:57.39,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,My Hybrid Count is down to six percent.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.65,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's cutting it close.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:12.95,0:16:14.16,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,A Dragorie?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.96,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's a Category-A Magitech weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:19.42,0:16:20.21,Dialogue Alternate,Y,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.50,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,My beam's power is dropping!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:26.21,0:16:28.63,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I can't move my hands...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.14,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Or my legs...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:31.14,0:16:34.43,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,My body feels... so heavy...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:38.02,0:16:39.10,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.11,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,My chest...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:08.55,0:17:09.42,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:10.84,0:17:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.26,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:14.26,0:17:16.35,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.18,Dialogue,k,0,0,0,,Julicia...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:19.23,0:17:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:21.52,0:17:22.44,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:22.77,0:17:26.07,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this for me when we've just met?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What... are you talking about?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:29.90,0:17:33.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,When a girl's... in danger...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's only natural to help her.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:38.54,0:17:41.71,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,That's the only reason he did this?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:42.92,0:17:45.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Run, Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:54.55,0:17:55.43,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:58.10,0:17:59.27,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.02,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:11.78,0:18:13.66,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.17,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,What's...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.72,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,this sensation?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.09,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:37.51,0:18:41.27,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Amazing. My whole body's overflowing with power!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:42.60,0:18:46.23,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So this is a Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:53.19,0:18:56.24,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kizuna, for coming to my rescue.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You just watch me now.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:04.37,0:19:05.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:06.46,0:19:07.50,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,my...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:09.29,0:19:10.67,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,showtime!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.34,0:19:16.26,Dialogue Alternate,Y,0,0,0,,Hellfire!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.40,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This time!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:37.66,0:19:38.49,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.37,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,The Entrance is gone!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.29,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Aine! Hayuru!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:45.29,0:19:46.29,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.54,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Julicia-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.04,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.46,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,The best I've ever been!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.34,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,I did a Heart Hybrid with Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:53.34,0:19:55.47,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,and now I'm better than ever!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.55,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Hey, Julicia...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:57.55,0:20:01.10,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So that means you, too, Julicia-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.72,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How could this be?!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We let our guard down today.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:10.27,0:20:13.57,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,When the tide goes out, that island increases in size
Dialogue: 30,0:20:13.57,0:20:16.32,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,and becomes large enough for an Entrance to appear.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:16.32,0:20:17.45,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,We missed that.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:17.74,0:20:21.74,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,If I'd known this was going to happen, I wouldn't have made Julicia go
Dialogue: 30,0:20:21.74,0:20:23.45,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,with her low Hybrid Count.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:23.99,0:20:26.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,After her Count got in the red zone,
Dialogue: 30,0:20:27.29,0:20:29.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,she seemed like she was in a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want to tell him, Reiri?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.55,0:20:44.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I think we can wait until you're ready.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,How could you keep me waiting?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.57,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:58.57,0:21:01.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,To do a Heart Hybrid with you, of course.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:01.20,0:21:02.95,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You don't even understand that?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I refuse to understand!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:04.99,0:21:05.99,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.33,0:21:10.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Are your wounds okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:10.67,0:21:12.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What about you? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.38,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:13.38,0:21:15.25,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:15.50,0:21:16.59,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:17.26,0:21:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do some more, okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:19.47,0:21:21.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm first, Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:21.30,0:21:22.51,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh my, Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:22.51,0:21:25.05,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You want to do a Heart Hybrid again?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:25.05,0:21:26.51,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you would.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:26.51,0:21:29.18,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,The one you had before was\N basically an accident after all!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:30.39,0:21:32.31,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hida-kun, this is Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:32.31,0:21:34.02,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.90,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,As a fellow Amaterasu member...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:38.90,0:21:40.86,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How obscene!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.03,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:43.66,0:21:45.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'll punish you!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:47.08,0:21:48.41,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:48.41,0:21:50.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No fighting in my room!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.63,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,High Commander, I've got my report!
